  "rows": [
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0173#11"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "光能对物体产生作用，因为光携带能量。\n麦克斯韦的电磁理论把光解释为电磁波，光的能量也就是电磁波的能量。\n光度学研究与视觉响应有关的光的测量。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": false,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0173#12",
        "p0174#1"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [
        "\\gamma"
      ],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [
        "\\gamma"
      ],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "描述光的能量传递，需要引入不同的物理量，其中包括光通量。\n光度学关注人眼能够感知的部分，并按视觉响应来评价光辐射。\n无线电波的波长很长，$\\gamma$ 射线的波长很短，它们都不属于人眼直接可见的光。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": false,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0174#2"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [
        "\\Phi"
      ],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [
        "\\Phi"
      ],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "光通量。\n人眼在通常的明视觉条件下对绿光较敏感，对不同波长的光并不具有相同的响应。\n因此，单纯记录辐射能量还不能描述它的视觉效果；\n\n还要按视觉响应评价这些能量。\n为此引入光通量，用字母 $\\Phi$ 表示。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": true,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0174#3"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "按视觉响应评价的、单位时间内通过某一表面的光辐射能量，称为光通量。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": false,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0174#4"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "也就是说，光通量是按视觉响应加权评价的光辐射功率，而不是把辐射功率不加区别地当作视觉效果。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": false,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0174#5"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "光源产生光通量，光通量到达周围物体的表面。\n描述这种过程，还需要表征光源的发光强度，以及表征受照表面的照度。\n先研究理想点光源的发光强度。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": false,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0174#6"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "点光源。\n当光源的尺寸远小于光源到研究位置的距离时，可以采用点光源近似。\n本课还作一个独立的理想化假设：光源向各个方向均匀发光；\n\n点光源近似本身并不保证这一点。\n遥远的恒星可以作为点光源近似的例子，尽管恒星本身的体积很大。\n这种理想模型保留研究中的主要性质，忽略次要细节，类似于质点、绝对刚体和理想气体模型。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": true,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0174#7",
        "p0175#1"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "立体角。\n描述光源向不同方向发出的光通量时，需要用到立体角。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": true,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0175#2",
        "p0175#5"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [
        "zh.prose[8] 的数学公式变化没有匹配已绑定勘误"
      ],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [
        "\\Omega",
        "R",
        "\\Omega",
        "S",
        "\\Omega",
        "\\Omega=\\frac{S}{R^2}"
      ],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [
        "\\Omega",
        "R",
        "S",
        "\\Omega=\\frac{S}{R^2}"
      ],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "从一个点向某个任意形状区域的边界作射线，就得到图 134 所示的空间锥形区域。\n它所张开的立体角用 $\\Omega$ 表示，并不要求边界是圆。\n以顶点为球心作半径为 $R$ 的球面，锥形区域在球面上截出面积为 $S$ 的曲面。\n\n立体角等于这块球面面积与球半径平方的比值：\n$\\Omega=\\frac{S}{R^2}$ (6.1)",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": true,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
