        "S"
      ],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [
        "S"
      ],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "同一组射线张开的立体角与所选球半径无关，因为它在球面上截出的面积 $S$ 与半径平方成正比。\n立体角的单位是球面度，也称立体弧度。\n一个球面度的立体角在球面上截出的面积，数值等于以相应单位表示的球半径的平方。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": false,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0175#7"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [
        "zh.prose[12] 的数学公式变化没有匹配已绑定勘误"
      ],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [
        "\\Omega=\\frac{S}{R^2}=\\frac{4\\pi R^2}{R^2}=4\\pi"
      ],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [
        "4\\pi",
        "\\Omega=\\frac{S}{R^2}=\\frac{4\\pi R^2}{R^2}=4\\pi"
      ],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "围绕一个点的全部方向所对应的立体角为 $4\\pi$ 球面度：\n$\\Omega=\\frac{S}{R^2}=\\frac{4\\pi R^2}{R^2}=4\\pi$ 球面度 (6.2)",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": false,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
