      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0175#8"
      ],
      "nativeTextErrors": [],
      "delimiterErrors": [],
      "mathSignatureSource": [
        "\\Omega",
        "\\Phi",
        "I",
        "I=\\frac{\\Phi}{\\Omega}"
      ],
      "mathSignatureCandidate": [
        "\\Omega",
        "\\Phi",
        "I",
        "I=\\frac{\\Phi}{\\Omega}"
      ],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "发光强度。\n发光强度表示光源向某一方向、单位立体角内发出的光通量。\n对于本课采用的均匀发光模型，若立体角 $\\Omega$ 内的光通量为 $\\Phi$，发光强度 $I$ 满足：\n$I=\\frac{\\Phi}{\\Omega}$ (6.3)\n\n如果发光强度随方向变化，这个有限立体角上的比值只表示该范围的平均发光强度。",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": true,
      "sourceSnapshotPreserved": true,
      "sourceRefsPreserved": true,
      "embeddedSourcePreserved": true,
      "textMatchesAuthoredList": true
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "sourceRefs": [
