        "\\Omega=\\frac{S}{R^2}=\\frac{4\\pi R^2}{R^2}=4\\pi"
      ],
      "inMemoryNormalizedText": "All directions around a point subtend $4\\pi$ steradians:\n$\\Omega=\\frac{S}{R^2}=\\frac{4\\pi R^2}{R^2}=4\\pi$ steradians (6.2)",
      "normalizationWouldChangeText": false,
